abstract: >-
  Analysis code, derived results, and data inventory for the shared hub-gene and
  immune-signature study of sepsis and ARDS. The archive reproduces every number in
  "Shared Hub Genes and Immune Signatures of Sepsis and ARDS: A Multi-Omics
  Integration" (Supplementary Methods S1-S14). Raw inputs are public third-party
  resources and are not redistributed; see DATA_INVENTORY.md and
  FETCH_PUBLIC_DATA.md for accession numbers, versions, and retrieval commands.
keywords:
  - sepsis
  - ARDS
